				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["In compliance with our jewelry sales policy, please be aware that all jewelry items are sold as is and are subject to inspection upon delivery. Following the purchase, we are not responsible for any damage or loss of jewelry. Prices are subject to change without notice, and all sales are final. Please note that any alterations or modifications to the jewelry may void any warranty provided. Customer discretion is advised when making a purchase, as refunds and exchanges are not guarantee."]]></textFieldExpression>
